    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "announce",
      "label": "the round is announced",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Round {round} of {total_rounds}. Kobayakawa: {kobayakawa}. Pot: {pot}. Kamons [seat, kamons]: {[[p.seat, p.kamons] for p in players]}. Players holding a kept card [seat, rounds held]: {[[p.seat, p.held_rounds] for p in players if p.active and p.held_rounds > 0]}. Start seat: {start_seat}. Minimum stake: {min_stake}."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "announce",
      "label": "your hand",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "acting",
      "fields": [
        "kamons",
        "hand",
        "held_rounds"
      ],
      "text": "Your state this round:"
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "draw",
      "label": "draw choice",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "KEEP",
          "DRAW",
          "SHIFT"
        ]
      },
      "store": "draw_choice",
      "text": "Your hand card was sent to you privately. The Kobayakawa is {kobayakawa}. Choose in secret: KEEP (keep your hand card), DRAW (look at your face-down reserve card, then keep either card) or SHIFT (vote to replace the Kobayakawa with the face-down Alternate). Nobody sees the choices until all are in."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "draw",
      "label": "drawers look at their reserve",
      "when": {
        "calc": "count(p.draw_choice == 'DRAW' for p in acting) > 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.active and you.draw_choice == 'DRAW'"
            },
            "key": "reserve_seen",
            "value": {
              "calc": "reserves[count(p.active and p.seat < you.seat for p in players)]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "draw",
      "label": "your reserve card",
      "when": {
        "calc": "count(p.draw_choice == 'DRAW' for p in acting) > 0"
      },
      "mode": "self",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.active and you.draw_choice == 'DRAW'"
      },
      "fields": [
        "hand",
        "reserve_seen"
      ],
      "text": "Your hand card and the reserve card you drew:"
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "draw",
      "label": "keep choice",
      "when": {
        "calc": "count(p.draw_choice == 'DRAW' for p in acting) > 0"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.active and you.draw_choice == 'DRAW'"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "OLD",
          "NEW"
        ]
      },
      "store": "keep_choice",
      "text": "You have been shown your hand card and your reserve card. Keep OLD (your hand card stays; the reserve card is discarded face up) or NEW (the reserve card becomes your hand; your old hand card is discarded face up)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "draw",
      "label": "drawers keep a card",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "face_up_discards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.hand if p.keep_choice == 'NEW' else p.reserve_seen for p in players if p.keep_choice in ['NEW', 'OLD']]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.keep_choice == 'NEW'"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.reserve_seen"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.keep_choice == 'NEW'"
            },
            "key": "held_rounds",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "reserves",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "the draw choices",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Draw choices [seat, choice]: {[[p.seat, p.draw_choice] for p in players if p.active]}. Face-up discards: {face_up_discards}. All undrawn reserve cards are discarded face down, unseen."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "the shift",
      "when": {
        "calc": "count(p.draw_choice == 'SHIFT' for p in acting) >= 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "kobayakawa",
            "value": {
              "calc": "alternate"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "At least one player chose SHIFT: the Alternate replaces the Kobayakawa. The Kobayakawa is now {kobayakawa}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "talk",
      "label": "talk",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "text",
        "max_words": 30
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} says: {value}"
      },
      "text": "Say one short thing to the table. Talk is not binding and may be false."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "fight",
      "label": "the fight begins",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "fight_choice",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "cur_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "start_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "fight_turn",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The fight begins with seat {start_seat}."
    },
    {
      "use": "repeat",
      "phase": "fight",
      "label": "the fight",
      "until": {
        "calc": "fight_turn >= len(players)"
      },
      "max": 6,
      "steps": [
        {
          "use": "update",
          "phase": "fight",
          "label": "what this seat may do",
          "do": [
            {
              "set": {
                "players": {
                  "where": "you.seat == cur_seat"
                },
                "key": "offer",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "['PASS'] + (['LOW'] if (not high_fought) and you.kamons >= min_stake else []) + (['HIGH'] if you.kamons >= min_stake + high_stake_extra else [])"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "use": "ask",
          "phase": "fight",
          "label": "fight",
          "to": {
            "where": "you.seat == cur_seat and you.active and len(you.offer) > 1"
          },
          "answer": {
            "type": "choice",
            "options": {
              "attribute": "offer"
            }
          },
          "store": "fight_choice",
          "each": {
            "do": [
              {
                "set": {
                  "player": "$seat",
                  "key": "stake",
                  "value": {
                    "calc": "min_stake if $answer == 'LOW' else (min_stake + high_stake_extra if $answer == 'HIGH' else 0)"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "set": {
                  "key": "high_fought",
                  "value": true,
                  "if": {
                    "calc": "$answer == 'HIGH'"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "broadcast": {
            "to": "all",
            "text": "Seat {seat} chooses {value}."
          },
          "text": "Your turn to fight. Minimum stake {min_stake}; FIGHT HIGH stakes {min_stake} + {high_stake_extra}. PASS stakes nothing and you keep your card; LOW stakes the minimum (only while nobody has fought HIGH); HIGH stakes the minimum + {high_stake_extra}. Choose one of the options offered."
        },
        {
          "use": "update",
          "phase": "fight",
          "label": "next seat",
          "do": [
            {
              "set": {
                "players": {
                  "where": "you.seat == cur_seat and you.active and you.fight_choice == ''"
                },
                "key": "fight_choice",
                "value": "PASS",
                "text": "Seat {player} cannot afford any stake and passes."
              }
            },
            {
              "set": {
                "key": "cur_seat",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "1 if cur_seat >= len(players) else cur_seat + 1"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "adjust": {
                "key": "fight_turn",
                "value": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stake",
      "label": "the stakes",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.stake for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "kamons",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-you.stake"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min(centre_feed_rounds_1_to_9, centre) if round < total_rounds else centre"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "centre",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-(min(centre_feed_rounds_1_to_9, centre) if round < total_rounds else centre)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Stakes are paid and the centre feeds the pot. Pot: {pot}. Centre: {centre}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "the showdown",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "fighters",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH'] for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH']"
            },
            "key": "shown_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fighters >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH']"
            },
            "key": "total",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand + (kobayakawa if you.hand == min([p.hand for p in players if p.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH']]) else 0)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fighters >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "top_total",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.total for p in players if p.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH']])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fighters >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "top_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH'] and p.total == top_total for p in players)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fighters >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.seat for p in players if p.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH']][0] if fighters == 1 else ([p.seat for p in players if p.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH'] and p.total == top_total][0] if fighters >= 2 and top_count == 1 else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "kamons",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pot"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} takes the pot of {pot}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": 0,
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH'] and you.total == top_total"
            },
            "key": "kamons",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(pot / top_count)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fighters >= 2 and top_count >= 2 and round >= total_rounds"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} shares the tied final pot."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pot",
            "value": 0,
            "if": {
              "calc": "fighters >= 2 and top_count >= 2 and round >= total_rounds"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "the fight result",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Fight choices [seat, choice]: {[[p.seat, p.fight_choice] for p in players if p.active]}. Revealed cards [seat, card, total]: {[[p.seat, p.shown_card, p.total] for p in players if p.shown_card > 0]}. Pot winner: seat {winner_seat} (0 means nobody took it). Pot now: {pot}. Kamons [seat, kamons]: {[[p.seat, p.kamons] for p in players]}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "cleanup",
      "label": "cleanup",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.active and you.fight_choice == 'PASS'"
            },
            "key": "held_rounds",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH']"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.fight_choice in ['LOW', 'HIGH']"
            },
            "key": "held_rounds",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.active and you.kamons <= 0"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.active and you.kamons <= 0"
            },
            "key": "active",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.active == False"
            },
            "to": "out",
            "text": "Seat {player} has no kamons left and is eliminated; their card is discarded unseen."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "start_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "winner_seat if winner_seat > 0 else (min([p.seat for p in players if p.active and p.seat > start_seat]) if any(p.active and p.seat > start_seat for p in players) else min([p.seat for p in players if p.active]))"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "any(p.active for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "cleanup",
      "label": "end check",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round > total_rounds or count(p.active for p in players) <= 1"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round > total_rounds or count(p.active for p in players) <= 1"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.kamons",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final kamons [seat, kamons]: {[[p.seat, p.kamons] for p in players]}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 10,
    "rounds_max": 10,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Setup: each player starts with {starting_kamons} kamons. The centre holds {centre_kamons} kamons and the pot starts at {starting_pot}. Nobody holds a card. Seat {first_start_seat} starts round 1. The game lasts {total_rounds} rounds, or ends sooner if only one player remains.\n\nEach round:\n1. DEAL. All cards {card_min} to {card_max} except the hand cards players hold are shuffled. Each active player without a hand card gets one, seen only by them. Every active player gets one face-down RESERVE card nobody sees. Then the KOBAYAKAWA is dealt face up and the ALTERNATE face down.\n2. ANNOUNCE: the round, the Kobayakawa, the pot, everyone's kamons, who holds a card kept from an earlier round and for how many rounds, the start player, and the minimum stake ({min_stake_rounds_1_to_9} in rounds 1-9, {min_stake_round_10} in round 10).\n3. DRAW CHOICE (simultaneous, secret): KEEP your hand card, DRAW (look at your reserve card) or SHIFT (vote to replace the Kobayakawa).\n4. Each drawer privately sees their reserve card.\n5. KEEP CHOICE (drawers only, simultaneous): keep OLD (the reserve card is discarded face up) or NEW (the reserve becomes your hand and your old hand card is discarded face up). Undrawn reserve cards are discarded face down, unseen.\n6. REVEAL: everyone's draw choice and all face-up discards are announced.\n7. SHIFT: if at least one player chose SHIFT, the Alternate replaces the Kobayakawa and its value is announced; if nobody chose SHIFT, the Kobayakawa is unchanged.\n8. TALK (simultaneous): each active player writes one short message; all are shown. Talk is not binding and may be false.\n9. FIGHT: each active player acts once in seat order, starting with the start player and wrapping around, seeing all earlier choices. Choose PASS (stake 0), FIGHT LOW (stake = minimum; offered only while nobody has fought HIGH this round and you have at least the minimum) or FIGHT HIGH (stake = minimum + {high_stake_extra}; offered if you have at least that many kamons). Once anyone fights HIGH, LOW is no longer offered. A player who cannot afford any allowed stake passes automatically.\n10. STAKE: each fighter pays their stake into the pot. The centre then feeds the pot: {centre_feed_rounds_1_to_9} kamon in rounds 1-9 (if the centre has any), all remaining centre kamons in round 10.\n11. SCORE: if nobody fought, the pot carries to the next round. If exactly one player fought, they take the whole pot and their card is not revealed. If two or more fought, all fighters' cards are revealed; each total is the card value, and the fighter with the lowest card adds the Kobayakawa value. The single highest total takes the whole pot.\n12. TIES: if fighters share the highest total, nobody takes the pot and it carries to the next round. In round 10 instead, the pot is split equally among the tied fighters, rounding down; the remainder leaves the game.\n13. CLEANUP: every fighter's hand card is discarded (they get a fresh card next round, held rounds back to 0). Every passer keeps their hand card, still secret, and its held-rounds count goes up by 1. The pot winner starts next round; if nobody won the pot, the next active seat after this round's start player starts.\n14. ELIMINATION: a player with 0 kamons is eliminated and their card is discarded unseen.\n15. END: the game ends after round {total_rounds}, or as soon as only one active player remains. The player with the most kamons wins; players tied for the most share the win (a draw). Eliminated players have 0."
}
